== Description ==

This plugin useful for export custom table called "customers". Its custom table. you can export values in csv format.

👉 Ready to Use
👉 Default Ready Colours and Values

== Installation ==

1. Upload the directory `/custom-table-csv/` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Click on the Custom Table export tab for settings.


